WEBVTT

00:08:59.829 --> 00:09:02.121
the substance of their argument, which,
you know,

00:09:02.121 --> 00:09:04.162
is likely to be persuasive if
they are knowledgeable.

00:09:04.996 --> 00:09:08.454
So I guess what I want to do is I want
to let people know that humility is

00:09:08.454 --> 00:09:11.037
a potential source of strength,
not just a sign of weakness.

00:09:11.704 --> 00:09:14.996
And I don't I don't entirely know
how to get people there.

00:09:14.996 --> 00:09:18.329
And I want to turn this around on you
because I feel like this is one of

00:09:18.329 --> 00:09:23.079
the the themes that that really cuts
through a lot of your work is every time

00:09:23.079 --> 00:09:27.329
I watch a show or a movie that was
directed or produced by you,

00:09:28.079 --> 00:09:30.329
I know it's going to lead me
to question an assumption.